// Syncthing ignore list for the shopkeeper folder.
// Syncthing carries CODE + the portable SQL dump (db/dumps) + .env between machines.
// It must NOT carry the things below.

// Postgres live data: machine/version-specific and continuously written.
// Syncing it WILL corrupt the database. Move data via db/dumps instead.
db/data

// Regenerable / platform-specific — recreate on each machine:
//   pip install -r requirements.txt · docker compose up -d · ollama pull <model>
.venv
venv
env
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
models
*.gguf
*.bin
.DS_Store
